# GNOME Data Format v1.0

## Hit Data
| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| timestamp | integer | Milliseconds since Arduino boot |
| hit_number | integer | Sequential hit counter |
| spike | integer | Signal strength above baseline |
| baseline | integer | Calibrated baseline value |
| latitude | float | Node latitude |
| longitude | float | Node longitude |
| elevation | integer | Meters above sea level |
| node_id | string | Unique node identifier |
| hit_type | string | stored or live |

## Node Data
| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| date_joined | date | Registration date |
| node_id | string | Assigned ID |
| username | string | GitHub username |
| country | string | Country |
| arduino | string | Board type |
| led_color | string | Detector LED color |
| status | string | ACTIVE or INACTIVE |

